source: ASF Jira Server 8.20.10, POST /rest/api/1.0/render (hack/jira-render-evidence.py), captured 2026-08-24
observed: The one-rune rule holds for the subscript delimiter, so Jira renders the tildes literally; jiro keeps them as text.
-- input.jira --
~a~b~
-- rendered.html --
<p>~a~b~</p>
-- want.md --
\~a\~b\~
-- warnings.json --
[]
